	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『ガンダムビルドファイターズトライ』より、最終話に登場しファンの度肝を抜いた「すーぱーふみな」が、ついにガンプラ化！",
			"• スカートには軟質素材を使用しフレキシブルな可動を実現！",
			"• 命とも言える瞳とまつ毛はクリアパーツとホイルシールにより質感を再現している。",
			"• ビームキャノンなど多彩な武装も付属！",
			"成形品×12、ホイルシール×1、組立説明書×1"
		],
		"en": [
			"• From \"Gundam Build Fighters Try\", \"Super Fumina\", who appeared in the final episode and shocked fans, is finally made into Gunpla!",
			"• The skirt is made of soft material to allow for flexible movement!",
			"• The texture of the eyes and eyelashes, which can be called life, is recreated using clear parts and foil seals.",
			"• Various weapons such as beam cannon are also included!",
			"Molded product x 12, foil seal x 1, assembly manual x 1"
		]
	},
